{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"7c111f07a9bd9423759abb7c8e169e1e99ed2bf1c6e109dc17b097e7eec739cf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你在這裏給我築七座壇，為我預備七隻公牛，七隻公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["巴勒照巴蘭的話行了。巴勒和巴蘭在每座壇上獻一隻公牛，一隻公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你站在你的燔祭旁邊，我且往前去，或者耶和華來迎見我。他指示我甚麼，我必告訴你。」於是巴蘭上一淨光的高處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝迎見巴蘭；巴蘭說：「我預備了七座壇，在每座壇上獻了一隻公牛，一隻公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華將話傳給巴蘭，又說：「你回到巴勒那裏，要如此如此說。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他就回到巴勒那裏，見他同摩押的使臣都站在燔祭旁邊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["巴蘭便題起詩歌說：",{"text":"巴勒引我出亞蘭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押王引我出東山，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來啊，為我咒詛雅各；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來啊，怒罵以色列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝沒有咒詛的，我焉能咒詛？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華沒有怒罵的，我焉能怒罵？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從高峰看他，從小山望他；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是獨居的民，不列在萬民中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能數點雅各的塵土？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能計算以色列的四分之一？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我願如義人之死而死；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我願如義人之終而終。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["巴勒對巴蘭說：「你向我做的是甚麼事呢？我領你來咒詛我的仇敵，不料，你竟為他們祝福。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他回答說：「耶和華傳給我的話，我能不謹慎傳說嗎？」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭第二次預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["巴勒說：「求你同我往別處去，在那裏可以看見他們；你不能全看見，只能看見他們邊界上的人。在那裏要為我咒詛他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["於是領巴蘭到了瑣腓田，上了毗斯迦山頂，築了七座壇；每座壇上獻一隻公牛，一隻公羊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你站在這燔祭旁邊，等我往那邊去迎見耶和華。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["耶和華臨到巴蘭那裏，將話傳給他；又說：「你回到巴勒那裏，要如此如此說。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他就回到巴勒那裏，見他站在燔祭旁邊；摩押的使臣也和他在一處。巴勒問他說：「耶和華說了甚麼話呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["巴蘭就題詩歌說：",{"text":"巴勒，你起來聽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西撥的兒子，你聽我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝非人，必不致說謊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也非人子，必不致後悔。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他說話豈不照着行呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他發言豈不要成就呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我奉命祝福；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝也曾賜福，此事我不能翻轉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他未見雅各中有罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也未見以色列中有奸惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－他的上帝和他同在；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有歡呼王的聲音在他們中間。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝領他們出埃及；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們似乎有野牛之力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斷沒有法術可以害雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有占卜可以害以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在必有人論及雅各，就是論及以色列說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝為他行了何等的大事！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這民起來，彷彿母獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挺身，好像公獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾吃野食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾喝被傷者之血，決不躺臥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["巴勒對巴蘭說：「你一點不要咒詛他們，也不要為他們祝福。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["巴蘭回答巴勒說：「我豈不是告訴你說『凡耶和華所說的，我必須遵行』嗎？」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭第三次預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["巴勒對巴蘭說：「來吧，我領你往別處去，或者上帝喜歡你在那裏為我咒詛他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["巴勒就領巴蘭到那下望曠野的毗珥山頂上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["巴蘭對巴勒說：「你在這裏為我築七座壇，又在這裏為我預備七隻公牛，七隻公羊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["巴勒就照巴蘭的話行，在每座壇上獻一隻公牛，一隻公羊。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}